      "lang": "en",
      "note_tweet": {
        "text": "I believe Traces are the essential new primitive of software development and agentic evolution.\n\nGit changed the world by helping us collaborate around the delta unit of code.\n\nTraces are even more powerful than that. They capture the upstream intent, prompts, reasoning, skills and tools use. They are your intelligence.\n\nYou should, of course, own and make full use of your intelligence. You start by securely capturing your traces. Then, set up the recursively self-improving systems based on the learnings they contain: friction, latency, outcomes.\n\nExcited to build this future with Tarun and team!"
      },
